# Oxo Synth2 for WebCLAP

Oxo Synth2 by chab, a free recreation of Daichi Laboratory's Synth1 (same 99 parameters, loads `.sy1` patches and
banks, same sound), ported to WebCLAP. This is not an official oxo_synth2 release.

- oxo_synth2: https://github.com/chab/oxo_synth2 (commit 5bce0fddf930b8bea1d7c9ec09cc08bb8f891e8a)
- This port, and the complete source of this bundle: @SOURCE_URL@
  Build it with `scripts/build-oxo-synth2.sh`, which fetches every dependency below at the commit named here.

## License

The bundle is licensed under the **MIT License** (`LICENSE`, oxo_synth2's), and every component in it is MIT, each
under its own copyright line below. The bundle contains no JUCE.

## Components

| Component | Copyright | License |
|---|---|---|
| [oxo_synth2](https://github.com/chab/oxo_synth2) (the `EngineCore` engine, unmodified, and the patch banks its own installers ship — `Synth2 Factory` and `Synth2 Starter Banks` — which the page loads as `ui/patches.json`) | 2025-2026 chab | MIT |
| WebCLAP port ([open-webclap](https://github.com/andremichelle/open-webclap) `ports/oxo-synth2`) | 2026 André Michelle | MIT |
| WASI shim ([open-webclap](https://github.com/andremichelle/open-webclap) `modules/webclap/wasi_shim.cpp`) | 2026 André Michelle | MIT |
| [CLAP](https://github.com/free-audio/clap) headers | 2014-2022 Alexandre Bique | MIT |

Oxo Synth2 is an independent recreation of Synth1 by Daichi Laboratory; it is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Daichi Laboratory, and no Synth1 code, binaries or artwork are used. Synth1 is a trademark of its respective owner;
`.sy1` patches load for compatibility only.

